{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52843","headline":"观会稽图 · 褚朝阳","name":"观会稽图","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"良使求图籍，工人巧思饶。\n全移会稽郡，不散浙江潮。\n夏禹犹卑室，秦皇尚断桥。\n宛然山水趣，谁道故乡遥。\n（见孔延之《会稽掇英总集》卷十五）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"褚朝阳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52843.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52843","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}